          "start": 957
        },
        "quote": "(b) Section C104, FEES, is hereby deleted in its entirety and the following provisions are substituted therefor:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.85.060:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.85.060 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "e711ba4a-c4d4-5c42-a0e9-a5364be66b85",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1345,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.85.060:block:6",
          "start": 1070
        },
        "quote": "Permit; Fees. Whenever any person shall erect, construct, alter, repair, move, improve or convert any commercial building that is regulated by this chapter, the person shall first apply to the code official and obtain a permit, if required, in accordance with TMC 14.20.060 .",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.85.060:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.85.060 block 7",
